#: src/resources/email/emails.gd:25
msgid "404 Not found"
msgstr "404 கிடைக்கவில்லை"

#: src/resources/email/emails.gd:30
msgid ""
"This email got probably lost during updates of the game, sorry!\n"
"If this happens frequently let me know at 99managers.org/bugs"
msgstr ""
"விளையாட்டின் புதுப்பிப்புகளின் போது இந்த மின்னஞ்சல் தொலைந்து போயிருக்கலாம், மன்னிக்கவும்! \n"
"இது அடிக்கடி நடந்தால் 99managers.org/bugs இல் எனக்கு தெரியப்படுத்தவும்"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Greetings Simon Dalvai
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:35
msgid "Greetings {manager_name}"
msgstr "வாழ்த்துக்கள் {manager_name}"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Hello {manager_name}
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:37
msgid "Hello {manager_name}"
msgstr "வணக்கம் {manager_name}"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: A warm welcome from the whole staff of Lisbon.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:40
msgid "A warm welcome from the whole staff of {team_name}."
msgstr "{team_name} இன் முழு ஊழியர்களிடமிருந்தும் அன்பான வரவேற்பு."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Lisbon welcomes you to a new journey.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:42
msgid "{team_name} welcomes you to a new journey."
msgstr "புதிய பயணத்திற்கு {team_name} உங்களை வரவேற்கிறது."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Next home match: Bolzano, Campionato A
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:50
msgid "Next home match: {team_name}, {competition_name}"
msgstr "அடுத்த ஓம் மேட்ச்: {team_name}, {competition_name}"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: The next home match of the Italy Cup is against
#. Bolzano.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:53
msgid "The next home match of the {competition_name} is against {team_name}."
msgstr "{competition_name} இன் அடுத்த ஓம் மேட்ச் {team_name}க்கு எதிரானது."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Your team is ready to play against Bolzano for the
#. Campionato A.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:55
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:65
msgid ""
"Your team is ready to play against {team_name} for the {competition_name}."
msgstr ""
"உங்கள் அணி {team_name} உடன் {competition_name}க்காக விளையாட தயாராக உள்ளது."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: You play the next Campionato A at home against
#. Bolzano
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:57
msgid "You play the next {competition_name} at home against {team_name}."
msgstr ""
"அடுத்த {competition_name} ஐ வீட்டில் {team_name} உடன் விளையாடுவீர்கள்."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Next away match: Bolzano, Campionato A
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:62
msgid "Next away match: {team_name}, {competition_name}"
msgstr "அடுத்த வெளியூர் போட்டி: {team_name}, {competition_name}"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: The next away match of the Italy Cup is against
#. Bolzano.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:67
msgid "The next away match of the {competition_name} is against {team_name}."
msgstr ""
"{competition_name} இன் அடுத்த வெளியூர் ஆட்டம் {team_name}க்கு எதிரானது."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: You play the next Campionato A at away against
#. Bolzano
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:69
msgid "You play the next {competition_name} at away against {team_name}."
msgstr "அடுத்த {competition_name} இல் {team_name} உடன் விளையாடுகிறீர்கள்."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Europe Cup semifinals against Bolzano
#. Example: Campionato A Semifinals against Bolzano
#. Example: Europe Cup Semifinals against Bolzano
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:74
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:86
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:96
msgid "{competition_name} {knockout_stage} against {team_name}"
msgstr "{team_name}க்கு எதிராக {competition_name} {knockout_stage}"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: This match is decisive for the Europe Cup.
#. Bolzano are good opponents but I'm confident we can win.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:78
msgid ""
"This match is decisive for the {competition_name}.\n"
"{team_name} are good opponents but I'm confident we can win."
msgstr ""
"இந்தப் போட்டி {competition_name}க்கு தீர்க்கமானது. \n"
"{team_name} நல்ல எதிரிகள் ஆனால் எங்களால் செய் பெற முடியும் என்று நான் நம்புகிறேன்."

#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:88
msgid ""
"This is the first match out of two for the {competition_name} "
"{knockout_stage} against {team_name}."
msgstr ""
"{team_name}க்கு எதிரான {competition_name} {knockout_stage} இரண்டில் இது "
"முதல் போட்டி."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: This second match is decisive Semifinals for the
#. Europe Cup against Bolzano.
#. The first match result was 5:2.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:100
msgid ""
"This second match is decisive {knockout_stage} for the {competition_name} against {team_name}.\n"
"The first match result was {match_result}."
msgstr ""
"{team_name}க்கு எதிரான {competition_name}க்கு இந்த இரண்டாவது போட்டி தீர்க்கமான {knockout_stage} ஆகும். \n"
"முதல் போட்டி முடிவு {match_result}."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: You team won the Italy Cup
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:109
msgid "Your team won the {cup_name}!"
msgstr "உங்கள் அணி {cup_name} வென்றது!"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Congratulations for the Italy Cup win!
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:111
msgid "The fans are excited for the {cup_name} win!"
msgstr "{cup_name} வெற்றிக்காக ரசிகர்கள் உற்சாகமாக உள்ளனர்!"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: We got the Italy Cup trophy
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:113
msgid "We got the {cup_name} trophy"
msgstr "{cup_name} கோப்பையைப் பெற்றுள்ளோம்"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Congratulations for the victory in the final of the
#. Italy Cup.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:116
msgid "Congratulations for the victory in the final of the {cup_name}."
msgstr "{cup_name} இன் இறுதிப் போட்டியில் செய் பெற்றதற்கு வாழ்த்துகள்."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: The Italy Cup cup win is a historic success for our
#. club.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:118
msgid "The {cup_name} cup win is a historic success for our club."
msgstr "{cup_name} கோப்பை செய் எங்கள் கிளப்பின் வரலாற்று வெற்றியாகும்."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: All players are happy for the Italy Cup win.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:120
msgid "All players are happy for the {cup_name} win."
msgstr "அனைத்து வீரர்களும் {cup_name} வெற்றியில் மகிழ்ச்சியடைந்துள்ளனர்."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Italy cup elimination.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:125
msgid "{cup_name} elimination"
msgstr "{cup_name} நீக்குதல்"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Italy Cup out
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:127
msgid "{cup_name} out"
msgstr "{cup_name} அவுட்"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Our Italy Cup journey is over
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:129
msgid "Our {cup_name} journey is over"
msgstr "எங்கள் {cup_name} பயணம் முடிந்தது"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Your team has been eliminated from the Italy cup.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:132
msgid "Your team has been eliminated from the {cup_name}."
msgstr "உங்கள் அணி {cup_name} இலிருந்து வெளியேற்றப்பட்டது."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Sadly we have been eliminated from the Italy Cup.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:134
msgid "Sadly we have been eliminated from the {cup_name}."
msgstr "எதிர்பாராதவிதமாக நாங்கள் {cup_name} இலிருந்து வெளியேற்றப்பட்டோம்."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: This won't be the Italy Cup year, we are out.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:136
msgid "This won't be the {cup_name} year, we are out."
msgstr "இது {cup_name} ஆண்டாக இருக்காது, நாங்கள் வெளியேறிவிட்டோம்."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Your team won the Italian League 1!
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:141
msgid "Your team won the {competition_name}!"
msgstr "உங்கள் அணி {competition_name} வென்றது!"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: The Campionato A regular season trophy is ours
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:143
msgid "The {competition_name} regular season trophy is ours"
msgstr "{competition_name} வழக்கமான சீசன் கோப்பை எங்களுடையது"

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: Congratulations for the 1st place in the Italian
#. League 1.
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:146
msgid "Congratulations for the 1st place in the {competition_name}."
msgstr "{competition_name} 1வது இடத்தைப் பிடித்ததற்கு வாழ்த்துகள்."

#. TRANSLATORS: Example: We won the Campionato A regular seasons! Now let's go
#. for the playoffs
#: src/resources/email/emails_generic.gd:148
msgid ""
"We won the {competition_name} regular seasons! Now let's go for the playoffs"
msgstr ""
